 * TAT.jsx — VENDOR + CLIENT TAT with Day-4 Drill-down
 *
 * PENDING-ONLY FILTER (this version):
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * TAT now only tracks cases where Status === "Pending".
 * All other statuses (Sent, Closed, Insuff, Hold, Stop) are
 * completely ignored by the TAT tracker.
 *
 * INSUFF TAT LOGIC (Client TAT only):
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * When a case status is "Insuff" in Client TAT mode:
 *   - Sent Date  → reads from "Insuff Date" column
 *   - Completed  → reads from "Insuff Clear Date" column
 *   - If Insuff Clear Date is empty → case is ongoing (TAT keeps counting)
